{"seq":1,"slug":"triton-block-programming-model","title":"Triton block-level 编程模型与 tl.load/store 语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/triton-python-kernel-compilation/triton-block-programming-model","wordCount":2150,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"triton-block-level-编程模型与-tl-load-store-语义\">Triton block-level 编程模型与 tl.load/store 语义</h1><p>一个 CUDA kernel 里你要亲手算 <code>threadIdx.x</code>，Triton kernel 里没有这个符号——你写的不是「一个线程做什么」，而是「一个 program 处理哪一块数据」。这个视角切换是理解 Triton 的前提：<code>tl.arange</code> 产出的不是一个下标，而是一整块<strong>偏移张量</strong>；<code>tl.load</code> 拿到的不是一次访存，而是一个 block 的向量化搬运。Triton 官方文档把这套模型称为 block-level programming（见 <a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/python-api/triton.language.html\">Triton 语言参考</a>）。本文拆解 program 抽象、指针算术、<code>tl.load/store</code> 的完整参数语义，以及这些选择如何传导到编译流水线与最终性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-program-而非线程是执行单元\">核心概念：program 而非线程是执行单元</h2><p>Triton 的 SPMD 模型里，执行实体叫 <strong>program instance</strong>（简称 program），通过 <code>tl.program_id(axis)</code> 在 grid 中定位自己。grid 不再由 block/thread 两级组成，而是一维或多维 program 数组；每个 program 处理一个形状为 <code>BLOCK_SIZE</code> 的<strong>数据块</strong>。官方 vector-add 教程把 <code>BLOCK_SIZE</code> 定义为 &quot;Number of elements each program should process&quot;，<code>tl.arange</code> 负责枚举块内元素（<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/getting-started/tutorials/01-vector-add.html\">Triton vector-add 教程</a>）。</p>\n<p>对照 CUDA：同一个向量加法，CUDA 里要写 <code>blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x</code>；Triton 里 grid 是「块的个数」，块内 128/256/512/1024 个元素的循环由编译器接管。下图标出从 program 抽象到硬件线程的两次降级——第一次在 TTGIR（把块映射到 warp 与 shared memory），第二次在 LLVM/PTX（映射到真实 lane）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;@triton.jit kernel&lt;br/&gt;每个 program 处理一个 block&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;TTIR&lt;br/&gt;块级张量运算,无 warp 概念&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;TTGIR&lt;br/&gt;块切分到 warp / shared memory&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;LLVM IR (llir)&lt;br/&gt;线程级标量代码&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;PTX / cubin&lt;br/&gt;真实 lane 与寄存器分配&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;GPU 执行&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"@triton.jit kernel&lt;br/&gt;每个 program 处理一个 block\"] --&gt; B[\"TTIR&lt;br/&gt;块级张量运算,无 warp 概念\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"TTGIR&lt;br/&gt;块切分到 warp / shared memory\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"LLVM IR (llir)&lt;br/&gt;线程级标量代码\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"PTX / cubin&lt;br/&gt;真实 lane 与寄存器分配\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"GPU 执行\"]</pre><p>关键点是<strong>块的形状是最重要的设计决策</strong>。<code>BLOCK_SIZE=1024</code> 意味着编译器要在 1024 个元素上摊派 warp，它决定了寄存器压力、shared memory 用量和访存向量化宽度。选错块尺寸，后面再怎么调 <code>num_warps</code> 也只是在错误的基数上打转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指针算术-用-tl-arange-构造偏移张量\">指针算术：用 tl.arange 构造偏移张量</h2><p>Triton 没有内建的多维数组，访存地址一律由<strong>指针 + 偏移张量</strong>表达。<code>tl.arange(start, end)</code> 返回半开区间 <code>[start, end)</code> 内连续整数组成的张量，是构造块内坐标的唯一原语。一维向量加法中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)&#10;offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)&#10;mask = offsets &lt; n_elements&#10;x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tl.program_id(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offsets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tl.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BLOCK_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offsets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_elements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tl.load(x_ptr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offsets, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mask)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>二维场景靠<strong>广播</strong>把两个一维 <code>tl.arange</code> 合成坐标网格。行主序张量的地址公式是 <code>&amp;X[i, j] = X + i*stride_xi + j*stride_xj</code>，Triton 写法用 <code>[:, None]</code> 让行偏移变列向量、<code>[None, :]</code> 让列偏移变行向量，相加广播成 <code>BLOCK_M x BLOCK_N</code> 的指针块（<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/getting-started/tutorials/03-matrix-multiplication.html\">matmul 教程</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"offs_m = pid_m * BLOCK_SIZE_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE_M)&#10;offs_n = pid_n * BLOCK_SIZE_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE_N)&#10;a_ptrs = a_ptr + offs_m[:, None] * stride_am + offs_k[None, :] * stride_ak\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offs_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid_m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK_SIZE_M</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tl.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BLOCK_SIZE_M</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offs_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK_SIZE_N</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tl.arange(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BLOCK_SIZE_N</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a_ptrs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a_ptr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offs_m[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride_am </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offs_k[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride_ak</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tl.arange</code> 有两个硬约束：端点必须是 <code>tl.constexpr</code>（编译期常量，才能定形状），区间长度最好是 2 的幂。一个 <code>BLOCK_SIZE</code> 块的起始地址与块内偏移满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>addr</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>pid</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>BLOCK_SIZE</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>BLOCK_SIZE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{addr}_k = \\text{base} + (\\text{pid}\\cdot \\text{BLOCK\\_SIZE} + k)\\cdot s,\\quad k \\in [0, \\text{BLOCK\\_SIZE})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">addr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BLOCK_SIZE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BLOCK_SIZE</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当元素步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（连续）时编译器能把块内相邻元素合并成 128 位宽的单次访存；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（跨步）则合并失效，块再大也只是在低效路径上堆量——这是第一章 coalescing 在 Triton 层的复现，参见 <a href=\"../simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/gpu-memory-hierarchy-coalescing\">GPU 显存层级与访存合并</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tl-load-tl-store-的完整参数语义\">tl.load / tl.store 的完整参数语义</h2><p><code>tl.load</code> 与 <code>tl.store</code> 是块级访存的两个出口，参数并不只是 <code>mask</code>。下表列出 2026 年官方语言参考中的完整签名与默认值（<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.language.load.html\">tl.load</a>、<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.language.store.html\">tl.store</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>tl.load</th>\n<th>tl.store</th>\n<th>语义与取值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>mask</code></td>\n<td>有（默认 <code>None</code>）</td>\n<td>有（默认 <code>None</code>）</td>\n<td><code>int1</code> 块；<code>mask[idx]</code> 为假则该 lane 不访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>other</code></td>\n<td>有（默认 <code>None</code>）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>被 mask 掉时返回的值；<code>None</code> 时<strong>未定义</strong>（undefined）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cache_modifier</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;&quot;</code> / <code>.ca</code> / <code>.cg</code> / <code>.cv</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;&quot;</code> / <code>.wb</code> / <code>.cg</code> / <code>.cs</code> / <code>.wt</code></td>\n<td>映射到 PTX 缓存修饰符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>eviction_policy</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;&quot;</code> / <code>evict_first</code> / <code>evict_last</code></td>\n<td>同左</td>\n<td>L2 驱逐优先级提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>volatile</code></td>\n<td>布尔，默认 <code>False</code></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>禁止编译器优化掉该访存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>boundary_check</code></td>\n<td>见下节</td>\n<td>同</td>\n<td>越界维度列表，按 <code>padding_option</code> 补齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条容易误用的语义：<strong><code>other</code> 不写就是未定义，不是 0</strong>——官方文档明确写 &quot;If other is None, the masked-out value is undefined&quot;，对加法这类归约，未定义值会污染结果，必须显式 <code>other=0.0</code>；<code>other</code> 会被隐式转换为 <code>pointer.dtype.element_ty</code>；<code>mask</code> 与 <code>other</code> 会隐式广播到指针块形状。另外**<code>cache_modifier</code> 对 load 与 store 取值不同**：load 用 <code>.ca/.cg/.cv</code>，store 用 <code>.wb/.cg/.cs/.wt</code>，填错会被拒绝。<code>eviction_policy</code> 在流式场景里很有用——矩阵乘的 A/B 面板每轮只用一次，标 <code>evict_first</code> 能减少 L2 污染，但这只是<strong>建议而非保证</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界处理的三种路径\">边界处理的三种路径</h2><p>Triton 里越界不是一种写法，而是三代 API，各有取舍。选错会让边界 tile 变成性能热点，或者让代码在目标硬件上跑不起来。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>典型写法</th>\n<th>边界处理</th>\n<th>硬件要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>显式 mask</td>\n<td><code>tl.load(p, mask=offs &lt; N, other=0.0)</code></td>\n<td>手写比较谓词</td>\n<td>全部 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>block pointer</td>\n<td><code>tl.make_block_ptr(...)</code> + <code>boundary_check</code></td>\n<td>编译器按 <code>padding_option</code> 补齐</td>\n<td>全部 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tensor descriptor</td>\n<td><code>tl.make_tensor_descriptor(...)</code> + <code>desc.load</code></td>\n<td>硬件 TMA 处理</td>\n<td>需 TMA 支持（Hopper 及以后）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>显式 mask</strong> 是兼容性最好也最啰嗦的路径。matmul 教程用它在 K 维边界构造 <code>mask=offs_k[None, :] &lt; K - k*BLOCK_SIZE_K</code>，在 M/N 边界用取模 <code>(pid_m*BM + tl.arange(0, BM)) % M</code> 把越界行映射回合法行——省掉一次比较，代价是重复读取合法数据。</p>\n<p><strong>block pointer</strong> 把形状、步长、偏移、块形状打包成对象，<code>boundary_check</code> 列出需检查的维度，越界处按 <code>padding_option</code> 补齐，谓词由编译器生成。注意 <code>tl.store</code> 签名里<strong>没有</strong> <code>boundary_check</code>——越界写只能靠 <code>mask</code> 或 load 侧屏蔽，这是 store 与 load 参数不对称之处。</p>\n<p><strong>tensor descriptor</strong> 面向 TMA 硬件。<code>tl.make_tensor_descriptor(base, shape, strides, block_shape, padding_option=&#39;zero&#39;)</code> 要求 base 指针 &quot;must be 16-byte aligned&quot;，且 &quot;Leading dimensions must be multiples of 16-byte strides and the last dimension must be contiguous&quot;，仅支持 2–5 维（<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.language.make_tensor_descriptor.html\">tl.make_tensor_descriptor</a>）。加载改用坐标列表 <code>desc.load([moffset, noffset])</code>，越界由 TMA 单元处理。代价是硬件绑定——无 TMA 的卡上走不通，且 descriptor 需要全局内存分配（须经 <code>triton.set_allocator</code> 配置分配器）。实践判断：Hopper/Blackwell 上优先用 descriptor 拿 TMA 的异步搬运；需跨架构可移植（含 Ampere 及更早）时回到显式 mask 或 block pointer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从块描述到机器码-编译流水线\">从块描述到机器码：编译流水线</h2><p><code>@triton.jit</code> 装饰的函数在第一次以某组 <code>constexpr</code> 参数调用时被编译，中间产物是分层 IR。GitHub README 给出了可复现的调试开关（<code>MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1</code> dump 每个 MLIR pass 前的 IR，<code>TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP</code> 保存各阶段 IR 与最终 ptx/amdgcn，<code>USE_IR_LOC={ttir,ttgir}</code> 提供从 IR 到 llir/ptx 的行号映射，<a href=\"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton\">triton-lang/triton</a>）。据此确认的降级链是 <strong>TTIR → TTGIR → LLVM IR → PTX（NVIDIA）/ AMDGCN（AMD）</strong>，底层由 LLVM 生成，构建锁定 <code>cmake/llvm-info.json</code> 的 <code>llvm_hash</code>。TTIR 是硬件无关的块级张量运算；<strong>TTGIR 是映射发生的地方</strong>——block 切分到 warp、layout 确定、shared memory 分配、软件流水线建立；LLVM IR 及以后是线程级标量代码。</p>\n<p>启动参数直接作用在这条链上。<code>num_warps</code> 决定一个 program 用多少 warp（默认 4），<code>num_stages</code> 决定流水线深度。matmul 教程的 CUDA 配置覆盖 <code>num_warps</code> 2–8、<code>num_stages</code> 3–5、<code>BLOCK_SIZE_K</code> 32–128 的组合，用 <code>@triton.autotune</code> 以 <code>[&quot;M&quot;, &quot;N&quot;, &quot;K&quot;]</code> 为 key 运行期选优（<a href=\"https://triton-lang.org/main/getting-started/tutorials/03-matrix-multiplication.html\">matmul 教程</a>）。<code>num_stages</code> 与 shared memory 是一对硬约束：深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的流水线要同时驻留约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 份面板，需求近似</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>smem</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sizeof(dtype)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{smem}} \\approx S \\cdot (B_M \\cdot B_K + B_K \\cdot B_N) \\cdot \\text{sizeof(dtype)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof(dtype)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超出 SM 容量时要么编译失败，要么 occupancy 被压得很低。这与第一章的占用率约束同源：block 尺寸、流水线深度、寄存器与 shared memory 共享同一份物理资源池，参见 <a href=\"../simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/shared-memory-bank-conflict-occupancy\">shared memory bank 冲突与占用率调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能含义-块尺寸与-warp-数的耦合\">性能含义：块尺寸与 warp 数的耦合</h2><p>Triton 把手动线程调度交给编译器，但<strong>块级决策</strong>仍在写 kernel 的人手里。几条可验证的规律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>块太宽反而更慢</strong>：每 lane 需持有的中间值随块宽增多，寄存器压力上升，溢出到 local memory 后访存代价反噬——1024 元素的块不一定比 256 快。</li>\n<li><strong><code>num_warps</code> 要与块尺寸匹配</strong>：块内元素数 ÷ (32 × <code>num_warps</code>) 大致是每 lane 处理几个元素；默认 4 warp 适合 128–256 的常见块宽，更宽的块需要显式上调。</li>\n<li><strong><code>num_stages</code> 买的是延迟隐藏</strong>：加深软件流水线能盖住全局访存延迟，但按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>smem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{smem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 公式吃掉等量 shared memory，与第一章的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\min} \\approx L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 占用率约束同源，参见 <a href=\"../simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/warp-simt-execution-model\">SIMT 执行模型与 warp 线程束调度机制</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>grid 尺寸必须用 <code>triton.cdiv</code> 上取整</strong>：<code>triton.cdiv(n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE)</code> 保证尾部不满块的元素也被某个 program 覆盖，漏掉上取整会让越界尾巴无人处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实用起点：先在 autotune 里放几组块尺寸 × warp 数 × stage 数，让运行期筛；稳定后把胜出配置<strong>固定</strong>下来。这与第二章 <a href=\"../cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-grid-block-thread-mapping\">CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计</a> 手工选 block 尺寸的逻辑一致——表达变了，资源约束的物理没变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Block-level 编程模型把「块」提升为一等公民：<code>tl.arange</code> 构造偏移张量，广播把一维坐标拼成多维指针块，<code>tl.load/store</code> 以整块为单位访存。语义上三处最易踩空：<code>other</code> 缺省时被 mask 的值是<strong>未定义</strong>而非 0；<code>tl.store</code> 没有 <code>boundary_check</code>；<code>cache_modifier</code> 的取值在 load 与 store 之间不通用。边界处理按硬件能力在显式 mask、block pointer、tensor descriptor 三条路之间选。所有块级选择最终在 TTGIR 阶段落定，<code>num_warps</code> 与 <code>num_stages</code> 通过 shared memory 与寄存器预算影响 occupancy——块级决策做对，线程级调优才有意义。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文属于本章「Triton Python Kernel 与编译机制」。块尺寸与 warp 的底层约束见第一章 <a href=\"../simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/warp-simt-execution-model\">SIMT 执行模型与 warp 线程束调度机制</a>；手工映射对照见第二章 <a href=\"../cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-grid-block-thread-mapping\">CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计</a>。章节目录见 <a href=\"./\">本章 INDEX</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Triton block-level 编程模型与 tl.load/store 语义","id":"triton-block-level-编程模型与-tl-load-store-语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：program 而非线程是执行单元","id":"核心概念-program-而非线程是执行单元"},{"level":2,"text":"指针算术：用 tl.arange 构造偏移张量","id":"指针算术-用-tl-arange-构造偏移张量"},{"level":2,"text":"tl.load / tl.store 的完整参数语义","id":"tl-load-tl-store-的完整参数语义"},{"level":2,"text":"边界处理的三种路径","id":"边界处理的三种路径"},{"level":2,"text":"从块描述到机器码：编译流水线","id":"从块描述到机器码-编译流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"性能含义：块尺寸与 warp 数的耦合","id":"性能含义-块尺寸与-warp-数的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CUDA 流与异步执行编排及数据竞争正确性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-streams-async-correctness"},"next":{"title":"Triton autotuning 与 TTIR/TTGIR 编译流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/triton-python-kernel-compilation/triton-autotuning-compiler-pipeline"}}